// EXPECT: E0229 for a `break` with no enclosing loop
// Nothing before MIR rejected this: `jr-hir` lowers `break` unconditionally
// without checking for an enclosing loop, and `jr-sema` ignores the statement
// entirely. So this is not a deferred check but a missing one, and MIR is the first
// pass that keeps a loop stack and can therefore see it.
main :: () {
    break;
}
